# Local `npm run dev`: leave this unset so Vite proxies `/api` → http://127.0.0.1:8001
#
# Vercel: set in Project Settings → Environment Variables (Production + Preview).
# Vite inlines this at build time. If the ngrok URL changes, either redeploy or
# paste the new URL on the login screen (saved in the browser).
#
# VITE_API_BASE=https://YOUR-SUBDOMAIN.ngrok-free.app/api
